# Applies to any `docker build` run with this repo root as its context
# (see server/otegami-relay/Dockerfile's doc comment). Keeps the build
# context small: `.build/` directories in particular can be gigabytes
# (SwiftPM checkouts of every dependency, including ones — MailCore2, GRDB —
# that the relay image never actually needs) and copying them in wastes
# both time and disk space on the Docker host.
.git/
**/.build/
**/*.xcodeproj
**/xcuserdata/
**/DerivedData/
dev/mailstack/data/
dist/
